# UI build artifacts. *_templ.go stays ignored (pure codegen; CI + the nix
# package build regenerate it). styles.css is COMMITTED since 2026-10-15:
# the CSS gate test embeds it, and a gitignored stylesheet meant CI and
# fresh clones ran the gate against an empty embed (the v0.2.0 CI red).
# The nix package preBuild still regenerates it, so the store build can
# never ship stale CSS; the committed copy is the CI/fresh-clone truth.
# Regenerate the committed copy ONLY with the flake-pinned tailwindcss
# (`nix develop -c tailwindcss -i internal/web/static/app.css -o
# internal/web/static/styles.css --minify`): a foreign tailwind produces a
# different artifact (unminified, different custom-property spacing) and
# re-reds the CSS gate (the 2026-10-15 incident this note was sharpened by).
*_templ.go
# probe codegen input ledger (scripts/lib/ui-probe.js ensureCodegen)
internal/web/.codegen-inputs.sha256

# Auto-generated by git-hooks.nix via nix develop
.pre-commit-config.yaml


# Audio never enters the repo: recordings are fetched from the source API at
# analysis time (the 2026-10-23 forensic pass) and would be both large and a
# privacy liability in git.
*.mp3
*.wav
*.pcm

# Build/export scratch (the .eventcatalog-hub.json recipes write binaries and
# export trees here; the auto-commit daemon committed them whenever a local
# build ran — 28 MB binaries as tracked files, the go-structure-linter
# "binary tracked in git" error). Generated, always rebuildable.
/work/

